{"id": "De4Vel3tpv5", "title": "Video by dayzero.story", "description": "Season 2 • Episode 3/5\nIf someone gets an electric shock, don’t touch them. Not yet. ⚡\nThe marks led Max, Nora and her father to an abandoned hospital, and to the last doctor in the city.\nReal tips from this episode:\n🚫 Never touch someone stuck to a live wire. The current goes through you too.\n🔌 Cut the power first, or push the wire away with something dry, like wood or plastic.\n🫁 Then check that they’re breathing and call for help.\nComment ANSWER or STAY SILENT 👇\nNew here? Season 1 starts with Day 1 on my page.\n#dayzero #survival #animation #survivaltips #firstaid\nWould you answer her?", "channel": "dayzero.story", "uploader_id": "23973906610", "uploader": "Day Zero Stories", "timestamp": 1792851826, "like_count": 540, "comment_count": 4, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2544287632729937a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 72.232, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO5WNmY8lrHvnE1gqAjmeSZ8oUFuCigKp_ZkI011gdY2M5s2zRj99-XJStuM1-WXYfSTdF23NLecGbIy0j_EAXvqdBcrVgG7DFsmrg.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adruvb5WzUMC0TkbreHVCb6Uw-cs1yTOW-bJAEXdlTska56Wzfie4dWgJr8RECDLvKKAOef24G9w8d1CEtaCIGJx&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=THVLruDLyh8Q7kNvwF34iUy&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=EETqaMxJroEKDY8yjT8KVw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSVRpfpy2RwbhL1jxFdiyaN4aNACl8xEnlofHfCnYINrg&oe=6AF41B8E", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 72.232, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.